{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06452","headline":"送乔琳 · 李颀","name":"送乔琳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草绿小平津，花开伊水滨。\n今君不得意，孤负帝乡春。\n口不言金帛，心常任屈伸。\n阮公惟饮酒，陶令肯羞贫。\n阳羡风流地，沧海游寓人。\n菱歌五湖远，桂树八公邻。\n青鸟迎孤棹，白云随一身。\n潮随秣陵上，月映石头新。\n未可逃名利，应须在缙绅。\n汀洲芳杜色，劝尔暂垂纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}